	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c06r0201_swleader6_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>タワーオブヘブンは
７ばんどうろを　いった　さきだよ！▼
とちゅうで　まよわないよう
かんばんに　ちゅうい　してね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T13:10:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T13:10:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>タワーオブヘブンは
７番道路を　行った　先だよ！▼
途中で　迷わないよう
看板に　注意してね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T13:10:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T13:10:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・msg_c06_swleader6_06表示後
　ここに出現
・r07r0101で博士と会話するまで繰り返し</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T13:11:08" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ジムリーダー
フウロ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-25T13:10:39" />
		</AttributeCell>
